# Patient data — NEVER commit real patient files
# But DO commit templates and knowledge bases needed for deployment
各癌种基因报告近年汇总/
*.pdf
# Real patient uploads / final reports dropped at repo root (e.g.
# "上传使用Excel表：….xlsx", "正确报告：…终版.docx") — root-anchored so panel /
# template assets in subdirs stay committable.
/*.xlsx
/*.docx
!templates/**/*.docx
!panels/**/*.docx
!data/knowledge_bases/processed/*.xlsx

# macOS metadata
._*
output/
